          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Add Contact Tag Action</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Use when automation should label the contact. Example: Contact submits form → Workflow sends confirmation → Workflow adds ACT-Completed-Assessment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Remove Contact Tag Action</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Use when tag is no longer correct. Example: Contact becomes qualified → Workflow removes STS-New-Lead → Workflow adds STS-Qualified.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Prevent Workflow Loops -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-rose-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-rose-100">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Prevent Workflow Loops</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-3">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Be Careful</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Be careful when one workflow adds a tag that triggers another workflow, especially if the second workflow adds the original tag again.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Before Publishing</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Write down which tag starts each workflow. List every tag added or removed. Check whether another workflow reacts to those changes. Test with one contact. Review workflow history.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Point -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-amber-400">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">Key Point</h3>
        <p class="text-amber-800 text-lg">Use Contact Tag triggers to start workflows when tags are added or removed. Use Add/Remove Contact Tag actions inside workflows. Always check for potential loops before publishing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Action Steps -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-emerald-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Keep the Tag List Clean</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Create Tag Workflow</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Create workflow with trigger: Contact Tag Added: ACT-Downloaded-Guide.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Add Actions</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Send guide email, wait one day, send follow-up question, add task for personal follow-up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Test and Check</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Test with one contact. Check for loops. Review workflow history.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      title = 'Use Tags with Workflows',
      lesson_number = 5,
      sort_order = 5,
      updated_at = NOW()
    WHERE id = v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Updated lesson: Use Tags with Workflows';
  END IF;

END $$;


-- Insert Quiz Questions for Lesson: Use Tags with Workflows

DO $$
DECLARE
  v_module_id UUID;
  v_lesson_id UUID;
  v_quiz_id UUID;
BEGIN
  -- Get Module by week number
  SELECT id INTO v_module_id FROM public.training_modules WHERE week_number = 12 LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_module_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Module 12 not found';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  -- Get the lesson ID
  SELECT id INTO v_lesson_id 
  FROM public.lessons 
  WHERE slug = 'use-tags-workflows' AND module_id = v_module_id;
  
  IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Lesson use-tags-workflows not found in module 12';
    RETURN;
  END IF;
  
  -- Delete existing quizzes to avoid duplicates
  DELETE FROM public.lesson_quizzes WHERE lesson_id = v_lesson_id;


  -- Question 1
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'Which workflow trigger responds when a tag is added or removed?', 
    '["Form Submitted","Contact Tag","Appointment Booked","Payment Received"]'::jsonb,
    'Contact Tag',
    'The Contact Tag trigger can start workflows when a tag is added or removed. Set the event to Tag Added or Tag Removed and select the specific tag.', 
    1
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 2
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What should you do before publishing a workflow that adds or removes tags?', 
    '["Publish immediately without checking","Check for workflow loops by reviewing which tags trigger which workflows","Delete all existing tags","Create duplicate workflows"]'::jsonb,
    'Check for workflow loops by reviewing which tags trigger which workflows',
    'Before publishing, write down which tag starts each workflow, list every tag added or removed, check whether another workflow reacts to those changes, test with one contact, and review the workflow history.', 
    2
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 3
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'In what order should you remove and add Status tags in a workflow?', 
    '["Add new tag first, then remove old tag","Remove old tag first, then add new tag","Only add new tag without removing old one","Remove both tags and add nothing"]'::jsonb,
    'Remove old tag first, then add new tag',
    'The removal action should come before the new Status tag is added. This reduces the chance of conflicting Status tags existing at the same time.', 
    3
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;

END $$;
